 exploit the chaos for profit, or stay out of politics and carve your own path. Your choices shape your identity, your reputation, and your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372530/extras/2626d1699611e0fa33ca418b5a460c51.poster.avif?t=1772046609\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372530/extras/2626d1699611e0fa33ca418b5a460c51.webm?t=1772046609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372530/extras/2626d1699611e0fa33ca418b5a460c51.mp4?t=1772046609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechanics Available in Early Access</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living World Simulation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 </strong>AI characters follow day and night routines, travel, work, and react to danger with or without your involvement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Roleplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Choose your own path as a thief, hunter, sellsword, or forge your own way through the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Tension and Conflict\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Kingdoms, guilds, and local groups pursue power, survival, and influence across the region.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Enterable World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Every building, cave, and point of interest is designed to be explored.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Systems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Hunt, gather, manage resources, and prepare for long journeys through dangerous territory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth, Stealing, and Crime</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Pick locks, steal valuables, and profit from risk while living with the consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp and Progression Systems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Set up camps, prepare supplies, and build a stronger foothold as your story grows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Party Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Survive alone or build a group and shape multiple lives in the same world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Death can wait behind every corner, but risk, loss, and adaptation are part of what make each run rewarding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Laps Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372530/fef109ed1219d6f5c1c5c2cc6628642443a54b69/header.jpg?t=1772046609","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3372530/1136559458/bb1cd0793c8c809c717b6117d5